      "content": "ugh ok thanks. i'm still looking at my statement and honestly it's stressing me out. it just feels like money is creeping up on me and then just... vanishing into thin air. i feel like i'm being tricked by these tiny amounts i dont even recognize.\n\ncan u look at this other batch? i need to know if these are actually bills or if they're just random junk eating away at my account.\n\nAMZN MKTP \nSQ *MAID SERVICE\nVERIZON WIRELESS\nVNDR *MISC \nMEMBERSHIP RENEW\nAPL*ITUNES.COM\nCHASE FEE - MAINTENANCE\nPYMT - CR CARD\nSQ *LOCAL CAFE\nNETFLIX.COM\nMICROSOFT*SUBSCRIPTION\nAMZN DIGITAL SERVICE\nCLOUD STORAGE FE\nWALMART\nTARGET\nSQ *PET STORE",
